flowchart TB
  A[Analytics Jobs source table · immutable] --> B{Required fields and schema confirmed?}
  B -->|No| Z[BLOCKED · correct import or mapping · no results]
  B -->|Yes| C[Profile row count, types, nulls, blank strings, and text availability]
  C --> D[Create temporary WORK copy · normalized title and text]
  D --> E[Remove HTML tags · normalize case/whitespace · preserve source columns]
  E --> F1[key_skills field]
  E --> F2[job_description field]
  F1 --> G1[Scan versioned canonical phrase dictionary]
  F2 --> G2[Scan same dictionary independently]
  G1 --> H[At most one hit per canonical skill per source row]
  G2 --> H
  H --> I[Count skill mentions and field-specific eligible denominators]
  I --> J[Compute share = mentions / rows with usable text]
  I --> K[Pair support and Jaccard co-mention]
  D --> L[Hash normalized title + skills + description inside WORK]
  L --> M[Report exact-text duplicate groups and excess rows]
  M --> N[Recompute as sensitivity only · keep original rows]
  J --> O[Stratified manual audit · freeze labels before changes]
  K --> O
  N --> O
  O --> P{Audit adequate and mappings reviewed?}
  P -->|No| Q[Candidate only · WARN / NOT RUN]
  P -->|Yes| R[Precision · recall · F1 · coverage · agreement]
  R --> T[Predeclared scenario comparison and rank/rate range]
  T --> U[Evidence passport with numerator, denominator, code/taxonomy version]
  Q --> U
  U --> V[Bounded descriptive sample finding · not national demand]
  C -. description missing means unobserved text .-> W[Do not infer skill absence]
  K -. co-mention is not prerequisite or causation .-> W
  M -. exact text match does not prove duplicate vacancy .-> W
